Export the hourly traffic history of single hosts, as shown by the
ntopng charts, to a CSV file (values in MB), straight from the
OPNsense web interface.

The plugin queries the ntopng REST API, so it works with ntopng
Community edition. Select a day and one of the configured IP addresses
under Services -> ntopng Export and download the result.

WWW: https://github.com/alivin70/os-ntopng-export
